    "identifier": "hebi-basilisk-art-ouroboros-circle",
    "description": "<p>You call upon your venomous heritage, summoning a serpent like construct made of your Viper Blood, that you command to encircle you, like a snake eating its own tail, before expanding outward in a 15-foot radius. All allied creatures in range without Viper Blood, lose all ranks of Envenomed, and regain 3d6 hit points, + 1d6 for each rank of Envenomed they lost.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the hit points regained by 1d6.</p>",
